[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8880.15, "timestamp": "02:28:00", "text": "是的。我简直无法想象他会是什么样子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8881.99, "timestamp": "02:28:01", "text": "你知道，就在我身后。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8884.79, "timestamp": "02:28:04", "text": "他只会照常过一天，谁也说不准。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8892.23, "timestamp": "02:28:12", "text": "是的，事情发展得真快。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8900.87, "timestamp": "02:28:20", "text": "嗯，怎么了？嗯，是的，我开始了我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8904.79, "timestamp": "02:28:24", "text": "天。我开始新的一天了。我在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8906.87, "timestamp": "02:28:26", "text": "是啊，你说你刚开始，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8910.07, "timestamp": "02:28:30", "text": "你刚才就像……嗯……刚才跟我说的那样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8912.79, "timestamp": "02:28:32", "text": "正确的？你刚刚开始了一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8918.23, "timestamp": "02:28:38", "text": "一切都好吗？任何头痛和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8920.309, "timestamp": "02:28:40", "text": "东西？你吃东西了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8922.23, "timestamp": "02:28:42", "text": "你一上车就立刻跳上了EC"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8924.15, "timestamp": "02:28:44", "text": "醒了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8929.59, "timestamp": "02:28:49", "text": "我吃了午饭，泡了茶，红茶。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8932.87, "timestamp": "02:28:52", "text": "嗯，是的。有热水了，一切正常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8935.75, "timestamp": "02:28:55", "text": "倒了水，然后把茶拿上楼去了。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8938.71, "timestamp": "02:28:58", "text": "楼上供应红茶。是的。"}]